.SH INTERACTIVE PROPOSAL REVIEW
.B --interactive
is supported for merge and rebase. Review each harness proposal before engine
staging: accept, revise with feedback, or stop. This is not Git's interactive
rebase sequence editor. Revisions retain current proposed files and require fresh
approval. Invalid input, EOF and interruption never accept.
.PP
The display includes diffs, captured contents and capture limits, rationale and
agent-reported checks and uncertainties. Final validation runs later. Approval
still requires engine checks; changes during review invalidate approval.
Each proposal, feedback and decision is retained in the audit separately from
application. Stop preserves files, the index and the active operation for native
Git inspection, continuation or abort. No rollback is performed.
.PP
No conflicts means no prompt or model call. Resolutions already staged by rerere
autoupdate do not pass through harness review.
